msgid "Congratulations, you finished this typing course! If you want to continue, you can, but this is the end of the instructions. You did a great job!"
msgstr "Félicitatiounen, du hues dësen Tippcours ofgeschloss! Wann s du wëlls, kanns du weidermaachen, mä hei sinn d'Instruktiounen um Enn. Du hues dat super gemaach!"

