msgid "T&yping Course..."
msgstr "&Tippcours..."

msgid "That name is taken: choose it in the list above."
msgstr "Dësen Numm gëtt et schonn: wiel en an der Lëscht uewendriwwer."

msgid "That's a mistake (mistakes: %d)."
msgstr "Dat ass e Feeler (Feeler: %d)."

msgid "The keys you're going to practise now are typed by the left and right index finger and further away from those fingers than the other keys we practised on the current row. Make sure you return your finger to its position on the home row when you're typing another letter."
msgstr "D'Tasten, déi s du elo übs, gi mam lénksen a mam rietsen Zeigefanger getippt a si méi wäit vun dëse Fangeren ewech wéi déi aner Tasten, déi mir op dëser Rei geübt hunn. Pass op, dass däi Fanger op seng Plaz op der Grondrei zréckgeet, wann s du en anere Buschtaf tipps."

msgid "To achieve that, you might try slowing down a bit."
msgstr "Fir dat z'erreechen, kéints du probéieren, e bësse méi lues ze tippen."

msgid "Too bad: %d mistakes. Keep practising to get better!"
msgstr "Schued: %d Feeler. Üb weider, fir besser ze ginn!"

msgid "Type the text below. The clock starts at your first key; a wrong key is shown in red and must be typed again."
msgstr "Tipp den Text hei ënnendrënner. D'Auer fänkt bei denger éischter Tast un; eng falsch Tast gëtt rout ugewisen a muss nach eng Kéier getippt ginn."

msgid "Typing course"
msgstr "Tippcours"

msgid "Welcome to the typing course. You'll improve your typing by doing simple exercises; between them, you get instructions. Let's get started:"
msgstr "Wëllkomm beim Tippcours. Du verbessers däin Tippen duerch einfach Übungen; dertëscht kriss du Instruktiounen. Komm, mir fänken un:"

msgid "Who is practising?"
msgstr "Wien übt?"

msgid "Words in"
msgstr "Wierder op"

msgid "You did it flawlessly and fast! Continue practising some new letters combinations to get even better!"
msgstr "Du hues et ouni Feeler a séier gemaach! Üb weider mat e puer neie Buschtawekombinatiounen, fir nach besser ze ginn!"

msgid "You did it flawlessly and fast! Continue practising with new words to get even better!"
msgstr "Du hues et ouni Feeler a séier gemaach! Üb weider mat neie Wierder, fir nach besser ze ginn!"

msgid "You made zero mistakes and are typing fast enough, so you can continue practising some new letter combinations. Keep up the good work!"
msgstr "Du hues keen eenzege Feeler gemaach an tipps séier genuch, also kanns du mat e puer neie Buschtawekombinatiounen weiderüben. Maach esou weider!"

msgid "You made zero mistakes and are typing fast enough, so you can continue practising with some new words. Keep up the good work!"
msgstr "Du hues keen eenzege Feeler gemaach an tipps séier genuch, also kanns du mat e puer neie Wierder weiderüben. Maach esou weider!"

msgid "You made zero mistakes. Now try to improve your typing speed a bit."
msgstr "Du hues keen eenzege Feeler gemaach. Probéier elo, e bësse méi séier ze tippen."

msgid "You're now going to learn letters that aren't on the home row. To see which fingers you need to use, see the keyboard image on your screen. When you're not using a finger to type a letter, put it back on the home row directly."
msgstr "Du léiers elo Buschtawen, déi net op der Grondrei sinn. Fir ze gesinn, wéi eng Fangeren s du benotze muss, kuck d'Bild vun der Tastatur op dengem Schierm. Wann s du e Fanger net benotz fir e Buschtaf ze tippen, lee en direkt zréck op d'Grondrei."

